# Role A — Voiceprint tool. Copy to .env.local to override defaults.

# --- Capture store (Role B handoff) — see HANDOFF-A-to-B.md ---
# Persistence is tried in order: Supabase → forward URL → local /data/leads.json.
#
# 1) Supabase (preferred): B creates the `leads` table, gives you these.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# SUPABASE_LEADS_TABLE=leads        # override if B uses a different table name
#
# 2) Or forward to a B-owned endpoint that inserts the row:
# LEAD_FORWARD_URL=
# LEAD_FORWARD_KEY=

# --- Voiceprint engine (Role D handoff) ---
# The mock analyzer in lib/voiceprint.ts needs no key. When D's Claude prompt is
# ready, wire it inside app/api/voiceprint/route.ts and add:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
